        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository c0ab162c-1502-40d5-801f-c5471289d6b7).Image",
        "Description": "47, we&apos;ve recently become aware that the syndicates  are actively monitoring our escape routes out of the venue. As such, our analysts have devised the following strategy  which should provide an alternate escape route that is not being monitored. We hope.\r\rGet the Pale Rider disguise.\r\rKill Sierra and Robert - they need to die while you&apos;re wearing the Pale Rider outfit.\r\rEnjoy Diana&apos;s unique dialog before exiting.\r\r\r = Sorry for main story targets, it&apos;s the only way this easter egg works =",
